OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny isolated showers in the
OL,6,Fmorning will fade away rather quickly,
OL,7,Fas cloud lifts and breaks into the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Becoming dry, with sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Feeling pleasantly warm for
OL,10,Fall in a light westerly breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA fine evening to come. A
OL,13,Fclear and dry night for all. Feeling
OL,14,Frather cool or even chilly in rural
OL,15,Fspots.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA dry and bright morning.
OL,18,FHigh cloud at times will turn the
OL,19,Fsunshine hazy. Feeling pleasantly warm
OL,20,Fto even hot in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
