OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure remains in charge for the
OL,7,Fnext few days. Although temperatures
OL,8,Fmay dip slightly on Monday, they will
OL,9,Fstart to climb again on Tuesday.
OL,10,FStaying mostly dry throughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
